scrcpy is not bundled with EDL-Commander.

scrcpy by Genymobile, Apache-2.0, https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy

The optional `edl-cli scrcpy` command launches a scrcpy executable already
installed on the host (from PATH, or from the SCRCPY_BIN environment variable)
so you can view and control a device once it is back in normal Android / ADB
mode. EDL-Commander does not vendor, redistribute, or ship scrcpy itself.
